              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "One Python model of the firm feeds a SQL star schema (SQLite and Snowflake), an Excel pack refreshed by Power Query, and this Power BI report.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#0f172a",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "The Simulator tests each decision before it is made: profit, the gap to budget, cash needed up front, and what happens if only half of it is delivered.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#0f172a",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "horizontalTextAlignment": "left"
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "Every number is checked: the SQL answers and the DAX measures are reconciled with the Python engine in automated tests.",
                    "textStyle": {
                      "fontSize": "9pt",
                      "color": "#0f172a",
                      "fontFamily": "Segoe UI"
                    }
                  }
                ],
